    "physical_description": "Garment made from two identical lengths (W. 50.4 cm) stitched along one side (selvage to selvage). \r\nWeft patterning spaced into17.8 cm. design repeats of <font -i>sun-kyo</font> (wave patterns), <font -i>gamoun</font> (creeper) & <font -i> nit lein kyo</font> (two twisted stripes) in orange, yellow, green magenta, white and peach.\r\nWarp patterning of broad green and orange stripes.\r\nOne end (L. 58.4 cm) finished in a broad peach and green plaid.",
